---
import places from '../../data/place-guides.json';
const featured = ['marine-drive-mumbai','gateway-of-india-mumbai','csmt-heritage-quarter-mumbai'].map(slug => places.find(p => p.slug === slug)!);
---
<div class="mw-home">
  <main id="mw-main">
    <section class="mw-hero">
      <picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/images/mobile/mumbai-night-480.webp 480w, /images/mobile/mumbai-night-800.webp 800w" sizes="100vw"/><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" alt="Mumbai’s skyline illuminated at night, photographed by Vikram SN" width="800" height="1136" fetchpriority="high" /></picture>
      <div class="mw-hero-copy"><span class="mw-eyebrow">BOM · MUMBAI · FOUNDER-HOSTED</span><h1>A little less<br>airport. A little<br>more <em>Mumbai.</em></h1><p>Turn your Mumbai layover into a city outing with a local host, planned around your onward flight.</p><a class="mw-primary" href="#mw-planner">Find my detour</a><a class="mw-hero-explain" href="#mw-how">What is a Detour?</a><small>Founder-hosted · A personal route · Time to return</small></div>
      <div class="mw-location mw-glass"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> Somewhere between flights.<small>19.0760° N / 72.8777° E</small></div>
    </section>
    <section class="mw-section mw-concept" id="mw-how" aria-labelledby="mw-how-title">
      <span class="mw-eyebrow">YOUR STOPOVER, OPENED UP</span>
      <h2 id="mw-how-title">Between flights.<br><em>Among locals.</em></h2>
      <p>Detour turns the time between landing and take-off into time in Mumbai. Step out with a host who knows the city—for a waterfront walk, neighbourhood stories, or chai and local food.</p>
      <div class="mw-host-note"><span class="mw-eyebrow">MEET YOUR HOSTS</span><p>For our first trips, you’ll explore with Gaurav or his co-founder—the people building Detour, and the people helping you plan.</p></div>
      <ol class="mw-how-steps">
        <li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Tell us about your stopover</h3><p>Share your flight times and what you enjoy. Save any places that catch your eye.</p></div></li>
        <li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Agree on a plan together</h3><p>Your hosts check the time available, then discuss the route, meeting point, costs and airport return with you.</p></div></li>
        <li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Meet your host. Meet Mumbai.</h3><p>Explore at an agreed pace, with your return to the airport built into the plan.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mw-expectations"><h3>Your flight sets the limits.</h3><p>Airport formalities, entry requirements and traffic all affect what fits. If your window is too tight, we’ll say so.</p><p class="mw-fine">Sending a request starts a conversation. You review availability, the plan and costs before committing.</p></div>
      <a class="mw-text-link" href="#mw-planner">See what could fit my layover</a>
    </section>
    <section class="mw-section mw-planner" id="mw-planner" aria-labelledby="mw-plan-title">
      <div class="mw-glass mw-plan-card"><span class="mw-eyebrow">A SMALL PLAN. A BIG MEMORY.</span><h2 id="mw-plan-title">Your time.<br>Your kind of <em>city.</em></h2><p>Choose a starting point. Your hosts will check what fits.</p>
        <fieldset><legend>My layover is about</legend><div class="mw-segments">{[6,8,12].map(hours => <button type="button" data-mw-hours={hours} aria-pressed={hours===8 ? 'true':'false'}>{hours===12?'12+':hours} hours</button>)}</div></fieldset>
        <fieldset><legend>I’m in the mood for</legend><div class="mw-moods"><button type="button" data-mw-mood="coast" aria-pressed="true">Sea & slow moments</button><button type="button" data-mw-mood="food" aria-pressed="false">Chai & local bites</button><button type="button" data-mw-mood="culture" aria-pressed="false">Streets & stories</button></div></fieldset>
        <div class="mw-result" aria-live="polite"><span class="mw-eyebrow" id="mw-result-label">YOUR STARTING POINT</span><h3 id="mw-result-title">A little city, a little sea</h3><p id="mw-result-copy">A waterfront pause and time to slow down.</p></div>
        <button class="mw-primary" data-mw-open>Plan around my interests</button><small class="mw-fine">A suggestion, not a confirmed itinerary. Traffic, airport formalities and flight times shape the final plan.</small>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="mw-section" id="mw-explore"><span class="mw-eyebrow">LESS CHECKLIST. MORE FEELING.</span><h2>Bring home<br>a little <em>Mumbai.</em></h2><p>Take a closer look before you choose.</p><div class="mw-places">{featured.map((p,i) => <article class="mw-place"><img src={p.photos[0].thumb} alt={p.photos[0].alt} loading="lazy" width="480" height="320" style={`object-position: ${p.photos[0].focus || "50% 50%"}`} /><div class="mw-glass"><span class="mw-eyebrow">0{i+1} / {i===0?'EXHALE':i===1?'WANDER':'LOOK UP'}</span><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.area}</p><a href={`/guides/${p.slug}`}>Explore this place</a><button data-mw-place={p.slug} aria-pressed="false" aria-label={`Save ${p.name}`}>Save</button></div></article>)}</div><a class="mw-text-link" href="/guides/places">Explore all {places.length} places</a><p class="mw-fine" id="mw-saved-count" aria-live="polite">Save places you like. We’ll include them in your request.</p></section>
    <section class="mw-section mw-practical"><span class="mw-eyebrow">FIRST, THE USEFUL STUFF</span><h2>Less figuring out.<br><em>More being here.</em></h2><a href="/guides/mumbai-layover-visa"><span>Can I leave the airport?<small>Entry requirements & documents</small></span></a><a href="/guides/complete-mumbai-layover-guide"><span>How much time do I need?<small>Airport formalities & return planning</small></span></a><a href="/guides/mumbai-airport-luggage-storage"><span>What about my bags?<small>Travel a little lighter</small></span></a></section>
    <section class="mw-section mw-ready"><span class="mw-eyebrow">BEFORE YOU STEP OUT</span><h2>A little prep.<br>A lighter <em>mind.</em></h2><p>Keep these three things handy. Tick them off as you go.</p><div class="mw-checklist"><label><input type="checkbox" data-mw-check="entry"/><span>Entry documents checked<small>Confirm your requirements in the <a href="/guides/mumbai-layover-visa">visa guide</a></small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-mw-check="flight"/><span>Onward flight details handy<small>Both dates, terminal and departure time.</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-mw-check="bags"/><span>A plan for my bags<small>See the <a href="/guides/mumbai-airport-luggage-storage">luggage guide</a> before you arrive.</small></span></label></div><p class="mw-fine" id="mw-check-progress" aria-live="polite">0 of 3 preparation steps checked.</p></section>
    <section class="mw-section mw-host" id="mw-questions"><span class="mw-eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU GO</span><h2>A few questions.<br><em>Clear answers.</em></h2><p>You can ask the founders directly if there’s anything else on your mind.</p><a class="mw-text-link" href="mailto:admin@detourtrips.com">Ask us about your layover</a><details><summary>What will it cost?</summary><p>We’ll confirm the experience price and any transport, food or entry costs before you commit.</p></details><details><summary>What if my flight changes?</summary><p>Email your hosts with the new flight details. We’ll reassess the route and return timing before you head out.</p></details><details><summary>Can you adapt the pace or food stops?</summary><p>Tell us about walking pace, dietary preferences or accessibility needs in your request. We’ll confirm what we can accommodate before you commit.</p></details><details><summary>Is my request a booking?</summary><p>No. Your hosts first check availability and feasibility, then agree on a plan with you.</p></details></section>
  </main>
</div>
